<title>USA: TABLE - Servico Inc Q2 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Servico Inc Q2 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2		Six Months</p>
<p>				    1997     1996     1997	1996</p>
<p> Revenues		    $71,176  $63,300  $133,823  $115,899</p>
<p> Recurring net income	4,143    3,250     4,452     3,820</p>
<p>Non-recurring gain, net</p>
<p>  of tax			     -	  -	   -     1,666</p>
<p>Extraordinary item, net</p>
<p>  of tax		     (3,751)    (202)   (3,751)     (202)</p>
<p> Net income			392    3,048	 701     5,284</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per common</p>
<p>and common equivalent share:</p>
<p>  Recurring net income	 .42	.33	 .45	 .40</p>
<p>  Non-recurring item	     -	  -	   -	 .17</p>
<p>  Extraordinary item	 (.38)    (.02)     (.38)     (.02)</p>
<p>  Net income		     .04	.31	 .07	 .55</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>   outstanding		 9,953    9,816     9,944     9,668</p>
<p>	   (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said it recognized an extraordinary charge of $3.8 million, or $0.38 per share, in 1997 Q2 for unamortized loan costs associated with the early extinguishment of debt which was repaid in the second quarter.</p>
<p>In June the company completed a secondary offering of 10 million shares of common.</p>
